  "notes": "PRELIMINARY product guide (2015) hosted by dealer WPPE, not the manufacturer site; chart states it is only a guide. Chart printed in kg, converted to t (/1000). 4 m row 13.8 m cell printed as \"53  600\" (split token) = 53.6 t, verified visually. Rated loads assume 8 m boom extension removed; if stowed, reduce by 770/610/510/430/340/280/240 kg for 11.0…36.0 m booms. All load handling devices are part of the load. Operating weight 71.76 t with 8 m extension, 17.44 t counterweight + 8 t carbody. Ground bearing pressure (no load) 0.77 kg/cm² stated (≈75.5 kPa) but not entered because it is no-load. Dims p5: 4.195 m from dimension split to rear (not labelled as tail swing) – tailSwing left null. trackGauge 4.1 m centres extended (5.0 m over tracks, 900 mm shoes); overallWidth 3.2 m transport. Max main boom tip height 38 m (tip, not hook)."
